Z||000003||theogre||11-16-2001||07:42 PM||||You mean your putting in an afternmarket electric fan?<P>run it from the OE fan relay and use a low temperature switch in the engine.<P>If you are installing an adjustable switch to control an OE fan follow the directions in my cave. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
